    "DecodeCyclicTagToCellularAutomaton[history, tapeLength] decodes the \
cyclic tag evolution history to the evolution of a 2-color, range-1 cellular \
automaton on a tape of length tapeLength. \
DecodeCyclicTagToCellularAutomaton[history, tapeLength, k] decodes history \
for a cellular automaton with k colors. \
DecodeCyclicTagToCellularAutomaton[history, tapeLength, k, r] decodes history \
for a cellular automaton with k colors and range r.", "synonyms" -> {}, 
